# data/models/* is intentionally NOT ignored here (unlike .gitignore) — the
# real trained checkpoints only exist locally, and the Docker build context
# is the only way to get them into the image; see Dockerfile for which
# specific files get copied. Trim the ones we don't want baked in: raw
# training-time checkpoints (superseded by their _final counterparts) and
# demo weights that are redundant once a real checkpoint exists.
